{
  "info": {
    "name": "Microcervices API Gateway",
    "description": "Test suite untuk API Gateway Traefik + Auth Service (Client Credentials, refresh token, scope-check) + service-ruangan (dipakai sebagai contoh business service). Jalankan `docker compose up -d --build` di `auth-service/`, lalu di `traefik/`, lalu di `services/service-ruangan` (cukup untuk suite ini; 6 service lain butuh kredensial DATABASE_URL_<NAMA> eksternal, lihat CLAUDE.md), baru jalankan collection ini via Collection Runner (urutan request penting, top-to-bottom) atau Newman (perlu `--insecure` selama Traefik masih pakai sertifikat placeholder self-signed, lihat CLAUDE.md bagian \"TLS / SSL (Cloudflare)\"):\n\n  npx newman run postman/Microcervices-Gateway.postman_collection.json --insecure\n\nGateway ada di https://localhost:8443 (HTTPS, entrypoint websecure — HTTP di 8081 sekarang cuma redirect ke sini). Demo client di-seed dari auth-service/db/init.sql (demo-client/demo-secret = scope penuh, readonly-client/readonly-secret = scope baca/lookup saja). Request 2.1/2.2 dan 4.1/4.2 akan balas 500 (bukan 200) sampai DATABASE_URL_SIADE_OLD di services/service-ruangan/.env diisi kredensial asli — itu bukan kegagalan test, lihat deskripsi tiap request.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://localhost:8443" },
    { "key": "demo_client_id", "value": "demo-client" },
    { "key": "demo_client_secret", "value": "demo-secret" },
    { "key": "readonly_client_id", "value": "readonly-client" },
    { "key": "readonly_client_secret", "value": "readonly-secret" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "old_refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "readonly_access_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth Flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Get Token - demo-client (full scope)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response has access_token', function () { pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "pm.test('Response has refresh_token', function () { pm.expect(json.refresh_token).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "pm.test('Scope includes read and write actions', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.scope).to.include('ruangan:list');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.scope).to.include('tagihan:create');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('old_refresh_token', json.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{demo_client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{demo_client_secret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Client Credentials grant untuk demo-client (scope penuh). Menyimpan access_token & refresh_token ke collection variable untuk dipakai request berikutnya."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Get Token - readonly-client (read-only scope)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Scope tidak termasuk aksi tulis', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.scope).to.include('ruangan:list');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.scope).to.not.include('tagihan:create');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('readonly_access_token', json.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{readonly_client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{readonly_client_secret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Client Credentials grant untuk readonly-client — cuma dapat scope baca/lookup, tidak termasuk yang membuat/mengubah data (mis. tagihan:create)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Refresh Token - rotate access_token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Dapat access_token baru', function () { pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "pm.test('Dapat refresh_token baru (rotasi)', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.refresh_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.refresh_token).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('old_refresh_token'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"refresh_token\",\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Tukar refresh_token dari 1.1 jadi access_token baru. refresh_token lama otomatis di-revoke (rotasi) — dites di 1.4."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Refresh Token - reuse OLD token (should fail, rotated)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 400 (invalid_grant)', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });",
                  "pm.test('Error is invalid_grant', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('invalid_grant'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"refresh_token\",\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{old_refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "refresh_token dari 1.1 sudah dirotasi/di-revoke otomatis waktu dipakai di 1.3, jadi kalau dipakai lagi di sini harus ditolak."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 Revoke Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('revoked: true', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().revoked).to.eql(true); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"{{demo_client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{demo_client_secret}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/revoke",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "revoke"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke manual refresh_token yang aktif (hasil rotasi dari 1.3). Mirip RFC 7009 — perlu autentikasi client."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.6 Refresh Token - after revoke (should fail)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 400 (invalid_grant)', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"refresh_token\",\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/oauth/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "refresh_token ini baru saja di-revoke manual di 1.5, jadi harus ditolak juga."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
